          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 1: Folio 2r, left side (Shuru\u0304t al-s\u0323ala\u0304t Section)",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">K\u0323ur\u02bea\u0304n ok\u0323umadan ruku\u0304\u02bf</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>itse, tekra\u0304r do\u0308nu\u0308b,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>K\u0323ur\u02bea\u0304n ok\u0323uya ve yine</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ruku\u0304\u02bf ide s\u0323on\u0303ra</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sehv-i secde ide.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Farz\u0307da ikinci rek\u02bfatda</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>tah\u0323iyya\u0304tdan art\u0131k\u0323 &lsquo;Allahu\u0308mme</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
