      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 1: Folio 2r, left side (\"Rules of Prayer\" Section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>If you bow without reading [a chapter from] the Qur\u02bea\u0304n,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>then go back</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and read the Qur\u02bea\u0304n and</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>bow again afterward,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>your prayer is invalid.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If, during the second rak\u02bfa of [one of the five] obligatory prayers,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>before the tah\u0323iyya\u0304t,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>you have already said&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
