      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 16: Folio 2r, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>to commit slander. The twentieth</li>\n<li>is to be envious. The twenty-</li>\n<li>first is to\u00a0</li>\n<li>oppose your master [or teacher] when\u00a0</li>\n<li>he has not violated the shari\u0304\u02bfa. The twenty-</li>\n<li>second is to call a man</li>\n<li>'stupid' without testing him.</li>\n<li>the twenty-[third] (bottom left)</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
